      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huntsville%2C_Utah",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The original settlers included Jefferson Hunt, his sons Joseph and Hyrum, and families of Joseph Wood, Charles Wood, Nathan Coffin, and others.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://huntsvilleutah.gov/history",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Huntsville is the only incorporated town in Ogden Valley, alongside unincorporated Eden and Liberty.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
